# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.

# Where the enquiry form POSTs (multipart/form-data, fields + optional
# `attachment` file). Until this is set, the form refuses to claim an enquiry
# was sent and offers a pre-filled mailto instead — it never fakes success.
#
# Works with any endpoint that accepts multipart POST and returns 2xx:
# a serverless function, Formspree, Basin, your own API.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
